{"id":1791641990982,"ts":1791641990982,"dur":111,"text":"On the 3rd of October you said, it's the same old loop as always, and this time I'm saying it calmly. How does that go? There is a button called Time Capsule, that you press and you can make the audio you're recording to be saved, unblocked, you can't listen to it, and in the time it's set, that audio appears again. This is especially interesting to combine it with Inside, because it allows you to create a reflection and in the future see that same reflection and see how your way of thinking changes. It's an application that allows you to recover your way of being, it allows you to think about how you are, to be more aware of what you're doing in your actions of your day, because reflection helps you think about what you've done during that day. It also allows you to see your progress over time. People are very powerful and don't like to use their own voice, but this application allows you to save both the voice and the transcription. It allows you to go back to the past and listen to yourself talking about something. Listening to yourself is a way of saying things, a way of self-convincing yourself, of supporting yourself. It's a way of seeing how you were doing things at the time, in a way that is more adequate, and then you can think about it. All you have to do is say it in a simple way.","audio":true,"audioExt":"webm","wave":[80,100,72,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,100,98,100],"capsule":1823151600000,"u":1791642000003,"words":[{"w":"On","s":9.16,"e":9.6},{"w":"the","s":9.6,"e":9.98},{"w":"3rd","s":9.98,"e":10.26},{"w":"of","s":10.26,"e":10.38},{"w":"October","s":10.38,"e":10.62},{"w":"you","s":10.62,"e":10.84},{"w":"said","s":10.84,"e":11.04},{"w":"it's","s":11.14,"e":11.3},{"w":"the","s":11.3,"e":11.62},{"w":"same","s":11.62,"e":11.72},{"w":"old","s":11.72,"e":11.96},{